[38;5;231m⏺[39m This one touches security posture, so I want your explicit go-ahead before editing rather than after.

  The change itself is one line — [38;5;153mconfig.js:3[39m, [38;5;153mSESSION_TIMEOUT_MINUTES: 30[39m → [38;5;153m480[39m. The consequence is that it extends the
